  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"font-family: Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">우<ruby style=\"position: relative\">얄<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’<ruby style=\"position: relative\">뽀<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˏ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ONOnzxHSmes?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    우<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">講<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">看<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">콸`-</rt></ruby>둏<ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"hît\">彼<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">日<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">띧ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">散步<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">산`버-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">淡水河<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.1em\">담쥐ˆ호ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    u-láng kông-khoà̰-tioh-lì hît-rît sàn-por-tam-jûi-hó\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">身邊<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">신ˉ빌ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"hît-e\">彼个<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">힏ˆ에-</rt></ruby></span><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一个<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇에-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">大帥哥<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">다`쇄`고ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    sīn-pḭ̂’e hît-e-láng si-jit-e-tà-soài-kô\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一時<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇시ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">雄雄<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">형형ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">忽然間<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">훋ˆ뗸간ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> 음<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">知<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">欲<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">如何<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">뚜호ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jit-sí hiong-hióng hût-rien-kân goà m-jāi-bêh-ru-hó\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">想欲<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">슐뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">問<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">믕-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> 우<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">影<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">얄`</rt></ruby>’<ruby style=\"position: relative\">뽀<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˏ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    siṵ-bêh-mng-lì u-yà̰’bó\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">講<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">겅ˆ-</rt></ruby>뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"jît\">這<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">回<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">훼-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">事<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">수ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">렣<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">烏白想<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">어ˉ벻슐ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    lì kông-bo-jît-hue-sū si-goà lêh-ōr-peh-siṵ̄\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"kông\">講<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">이<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">只<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">지ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"jit-e\">一个<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇에-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"phôr-thông\">普通<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">퍼ˆ텅ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"pieng-yù\">朋友<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">볭유`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    lì kông-ī jî-si-jit-e-phôr-thông’e pieng-yù\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"jît-e\">這个<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">짇ˆ에</rt></ruby></span><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">理由<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">리ˆ유ˊ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"jiâh\">遮<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">勉強<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">뼨ˆ경`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jît-e-lî-yú, jiâh-biên-kiòng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> 야<span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">猶原<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">유ˉ꽌ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">激慐慐<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">곅ˆ껑껑ˉ</rt></ruby><a href=\"#_ftn1\" id=\"_ftnref1\"><strong>¹</strong></a>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goà ya-yū-goán, kiêk-gong-gōng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">若<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">나</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">欲<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: n