1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> 우<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">影<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">얄`</rt></ruby>’<ruby style=\"position: relative\">뽀<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˏ</rt></ruby>)\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    (siṵ-bêh-mng-lì u-yà̰’bó)\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">講<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">겅ˆ-</rt></ruby>뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"jît\">這<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">回<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">훼-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">事<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">수ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">렣<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">烏白想<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">어ˉ벻슐ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    lì kông-bo-jît-hue-sū si-goà lêh-ōr-peh-siṵ̄\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"kông\">講<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">이<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">只<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">지ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"jit-e\">一个<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇에-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"phôr-thông\">普通<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">퍼ˆ텅ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"pieng-yù\">朋友<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">볭유`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    lì kông-ī jî-si-jit-e-phôr-thông’e pieng-yù\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"jît-e\">這个<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">짇ˆ에</rt></ruby></span><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">理由<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">리ˆ유ˊ</rt></ruby>, <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"jiâh\">遮<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">勉強<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">뼨ˆ경`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jît-e-lî-yú, jiâh-biên-kiòng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> 야<span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">猶原<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">유ˉ꽌ˊ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">激慐慐<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">곅ˆ껑껑ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goà ya-yū-goán, kiêk-gong-gōng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">若<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">나</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">欲<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">佮<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">切<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">체</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    lì na-bêh-kâh-goâ-che\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> 뾔<ruby style=\"position: relative\">곻<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">再<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">재`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">囉嗦<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">로ˉ소ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goà boe-kôh-jài-lō-sô\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    우<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">影<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">얄`</rt></ruby>’<ruby style=\"position: relative\">뽀<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˏ</rt></ruby> 우<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">影<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">얄`</rt></ruby>’<ruby style=\"position: relative\">뽀<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˏ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    u-yà̰’bó u-yà̰’bó\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<table class=\"wp-block-table alignleft\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;border: none;font-size: 16px\">\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <td style=\"border: none;vertical-align: top;min-width: 5em;padding-right: 1.5em;padding-left: 0;padding-top: 0;padding-bottom: 0\">\n  <a href=\"#_ftnref1\" id=\"_ftn1\">¹</a>\n  <i>\n    <span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">激慐慐<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.3em;left: 1.1em\">곅ˆ껑껑ˉ</rt></ruby></span>\n  </i> :\n</td>\n    <td style=\"border: none;padding: 0\">\n      (中) 裝傻，又作「激戇戇」。<br>\n      (en) Feign ignorance.\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<div style=\"clear: both;margin-bottom: 1em\"></div>\n"
